      "question": "If I select a Character I played this turn as the target of this [On Play] effect, will that Character be able to attack active Characters?",
      "answer": "No, it will not. This effect allows the selected Leader or Character to attack active Characters. However, because you cannot declare an attack with a Character on the turn it is played, the Character in question will not be able to attack active Characters.",
